# Content and source files are LF in the repository. Without this, a Windows
# checkout (core.autocrlf=true) rewrites them to CRLF, which breaks the
# line-anchored regexes in scripts/lint-*.mjs (## headings stop matching
# because the trailing \r is part of the line).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.vue text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.jsonc text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf